{"id":"s1.1","slug":"foiling-when-multiplying","title":"FOILing/LIOFing When Multiplying","content":"<p class=\"mb-4\">A fast multiplication method for two-digit numbers, $ab$ and $cd$, is LIOFing (Last-Inner+Outer-First). This is derived from the algebraic expansion $(10a + b)(10c + d) = 100(ac) + 10(ad + bc) + bd$.</p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mb-4\"><li><strong>Last:</strong> The ones digit is $b \\times d$.</li><li><strong>Inner+Outer:</strong> The tens digit is $(a \\times d) + (b \\times c)$.</li><li><strong>First:</strong> The hundreds digit is $a \\times c$.</li><li>Remember to handle carries at each step. For example, $74 \\times 23$: Last is $4 \\times 3 = 12$ (write 2, carry 1). Inner+Outer is $(7 \\times 3) + (2 \\times 4) + 1_{carry} = 21 + 8 + 1 = 30$ (write 0, carry 3). First is $(7 \\times 2) + 3_{carry} = 14 + 3 = 17$. The result is 1702.</li></ul>","summary":"A fast multiplication method for two-digit numbers, and , is LIOFing (Last-Inner+Outer-First).","generation_guideline":"Generate a multiplication problem involving two 2-digit numbers.","questions":[{"id":1,"text":"Calculate $95 \\times 30$.","answer":"2850","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":2,"text":"Calculate $90 \\times 78$.","answer":"7020","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":3,"text":"Calculate $51 \\times 11$.","answer":"561","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":4,"text":"Calculate $83 \\times 51$.","answer":"4233","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":5,"text":"Calculate $64 \\times 53$.","answer":"3392","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":6,"text":"Calculate $65 \\times 81$.","answer":"5265","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":7,"text":"Calculate $92 \\times 76$.","answer":"6992","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":8,"text":"Calculate $25 \\times 46$.","answer":"1150","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":9,"text":"Calculate $94 \\times 92$.","answer":"8648","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":10,"text":"Ca